   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m attempting to use <font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><b>dput </b></font>and <font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><b>dget </b></font>on <font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><b>pcountOpen </b></font>results.  <font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><b>dput </b></font>works fine but when I attempt to use <font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><b>dget </b></font>to retrieve the results, I get an error.  Here is the example used in the documentation.<div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">set.seed(3)</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">M &lt;- 50</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">T &lt;- 5</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">lambda &lt;- 4</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">gamma &lt;- 1.5</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">omega &lt;- 0.8</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">p &lt;- 0.7</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">y &lt;- N &lt;- matrix(NA, M, T)</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">S &lt;- G &lt;- matrix(NA, M, T-1)</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">N[,1] &lt;- rpois(M, lambda)</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">for(t in 1:(T-1)) {</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>S[,t] &lt;- rbinom(M, N[,t], omega)</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>G[,t] &lt;- rpois(M, gamma)</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>N[,t+1] &lt;- S[,t] + G[,t]</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>}</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">y[] &lt;- rbinom(M*T, N, p)</font></div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"># Prepare data</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">umf &lt;- unmarkedFramePCO(y = y, numPrimary=T)</font></div></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"># Fit model and backtransform</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">m1 &lt;- pcountOpen(~1, ~1, ~1, ~1, umf, K=20)</font></div></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">dput(m1,&quot;m1.txt&quot;)  # Works fine.</font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">mx = dget(&quot;m1.txt&quot;)</font></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\">Error in parse(file = file, keep.source = keep.source) : </font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\">  m1.txt:58:43: unexpected &#39;&lt;&#39;</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\">57:     , estimates = new(&quot;unmarkedEstimateList&quot;</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\">58:     , estimates = structure(list(lambda = &lt;</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\">                                              ^</font></div></div></blockquote><div>This occurs in the <b><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">m1.txt</font></b> file in the surrounding lines</div><div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">, estimates = new(&quot;unmarkedEstimateList&quot;</font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">   <font color=\"#ff0000\"> , estimates = structure(list(lambda = &lt;</font>S4 object of class structure(&quot;unmarkedEstimate&quot;, package = &quot;unmarked&quot;)&gt;, </font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">    gamma = &lt;S4 object of class structure(&quot;unmarkedEstimate&quot;, package = &quot;unmarked&quot;)&gt;, </font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">    omega = &lt;S4 object of class structure(&quot;unmarkedEstimate&quot;, package = &quot;unmarked&quot;)&gt;, </font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">    det = &lt;S4 object of class structure(&quot;unmarkedEstimate&quot;, package = &quot;unmarked&quot;)&gt;), .Names = c(&quot;lambda&quot;, </font></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">&quot;gamma&quot;, &quot;omega&quot;, &quot;det&quot;))</font></div></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div></blockquote><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">So it seems that it chokes on &quot;</font><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">&lt;S4 object of class structure</font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&quot;.  Any suggestions as to how to make </font><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><b>dget</b></font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><b> </b>work with the </font><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><b>pcountOpen </b></font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">output?  Am I out of luck because of S4 objects?</font><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Thanks,</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Jim</font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
